        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: HMS Sussex\n- Organizations: English Royal Navy\n- Places: Kingdom of England, Great Britain, Scotland, Kingdom of Great Britain\n- Concepts: Anglo-Saxon kingdoms\n\nFacts:\n- The Kingdom of England existed on the island of Great Britain from the 10th century until 1707.\n- The Kingdom of England emerged from 16 Anglo-Saxon kingdoms in the 10th century.\n- In 1707, the Kingdom of England united with Scotland to form the Kingdom of Great Britain.\n- HMS Sussex was an 80-gun third-rate ship of the line in the English Royal Navy.\n- HMS Sussex served the Kingdom of England.",
